{"id":"661867","name":"黄豆炖猪蹄","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/661867/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪蹄","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄豆","amount":"一小把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄豆提前泡软。","img":"images/661867/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪蹄凉水下锅，加入料酒，葱姜煮开去腥。","img":"images/661867/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出来冲洗干净。","img":"images/661867/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备好调料。","img":"images/661867/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里倒油，下入调料炒香。","img":"images/661867/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入猪蹄翻炒至表面微黄，加入料酒翻炒。","img":"images/661867/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入生抽老抽，十三香炒匀。","img":"images/661867/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入压力锅，加入蚝油和盐，压熟。","img":"images/661867/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再倒入炒锅，加入黄豆炖煮，大火收汁。","img":"images/661867/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"香浓软糯～","img":"images/661867/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}